{"title": "Accursed Coins", "pageid": 12395, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Accursed_Coins", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Gold_Pile_Medium_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fa/Gold_Pile_Medium_Icon.png/300px-Gold_Pile_Medium_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fa/Gold_Pile_Medium_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fa/Gold_Pile_Medium_Icon.png/300px-Gold_Pile_Medium_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fa/Gold_Pile_Medium_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Accursed Coins</b> is a passive feature unique to the toll collector's visages.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>This cursed visage controls part of the coins protecting the <a href=\"/wiki/Gerringothe_Thorm\" title=\"Gerringothe Thorm\">Toll Collector</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Visage_of_Cowardice\" title=\"Visage of Cowardice\">Visage of Cowardice</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Visage_of_Greed\" title=\"Visage of Greed\">Visage of Greed</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Visage_of_Guilt\" title=\"Visage of Guilt\">Visage of Guilt</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Visage_of_Heartlessness\" title=\"Visage of Heartlessness\">Visage of Heartlessness</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Visage_of_Obedience\" title=\"Visage of Obedience\">Visage of Obedienc